function return value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("return", value)

function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

to get left - right:
    return @intrinsic("subtract", left, right)

to get value adjusted:
    return value

[a|] byte means: @intrinsic("type", "int", 8)

to get the tested form of value:
    return value - 1 adjusted

ignore @intrinsic("array", the tested form of 4, a byte)
